## Import

Fastly Integrations can be imported using their integration ID, e.g.

```shell
terraform import fastly_integration.example <integration_id>
```

-> **Note:** The Fastly API never returns `config` on read, regardless of `type`, since it may
contain write-only fields (e.g. API keys or tokens). Importing a `fastly_integration` will
therefore always show a diff on `config` until the next `apply` re-applies the configured value.
